  "commit_message": "Bound Pixel iterator for empty images\n\nThe approach here is to fully avoid any modification to its internal\nstate when an empty image is provided. By slightly strengthening its\ninvariants, x < self.width except for empty images, we can achieve this\nwithout additional branches in its `next` method. This also avoids the\npeculiar code path of incrementing `y` after the last pixel when the\nIterator is not used as a fuse'd one.",
